  "arguments": {
    "hypothesis": "The bug is likely due to the incorrect handling of CRLF sequences in the decodeQuotedPrintable method. The method should skip CRLF sequences when they are part of a soft line break, but the current logic does not account for this, leading to incorrect decoding."
  }
}
